    {
      "id": "d3cd2716-f6cc-40df-a76c-6dcf00607e49",
      "title": "Passe pelas três falas e observe como cada uma resolve uma parte do convite.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4bae8976-b8df-4d11-b3cd-bbf27dfd2ce3",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Te apetece tomar algo después de clase?</strong></p><p>Abre um convite casual sem pressionar a outra pessoa.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/947a0d33b9ce455bad988c83adea280b_l03b02-te-apetece-tomar-algo-despues-de-clase.mp3?Expires=1794099574&Signature=qcE5Wcs8QTALInhm6R3mZW1hnP6d6A6lMDX1AvJtO4mgGRtw6A7pb-pfCRW5XXTOmqJHGCFZuqX-pA~~pZFYdIIdPNHcI7pN4cm6WvgCdF-vCUAO28V03KT41de6kO88XHg2hirlSHbyy-IIj5hEVJycCJkjFfSPl7NGqzl0sfRyawsJhmPYVe15Y71y4QYDdZLL87n2s~d9pox04zL5rp7WqGT9R6QtxICZaA1J-Yrso584FU4zNTp35DY8mMFgQptUVJdfZ0ltxzL3Sr7E1a3SzzyBE2z1-Uba5rGBbRgwZNZM0qDcse-zF-8-n4kpfXSQHcClkgrzaAZrMelv6g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "bce5ec50-d45a-4842-b274-65e34a8f0581",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me encantaría.</strong></p><p>Aceita o plano com calor e naturalidade.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f0322b4602a046f1a9854c17e15deeee_l03b06-me-encantaria.mp3?Expires=1794099574&Signature=NbVkwL-fJJJJkHIOGtIYVbYNoNl4j4EeXpkymyhVDufFdbimtHdft9WfLTwvmNbLm6VRNlFQ7tAOd0QicZUkkanVN7zrfIW8UIWfgt6adR5JVAhTP92qwU3VlSrHqVGTCSNFHaSxQ98XPQjz5VwAHctemj8rb0iFWrA7Kn-dJmZ26sXLv~7c8c38d0ONVmO~CS6qswuCk6864KJaZZqoMyGdakwpT~XhveqOtQ9dzwrxDsLR1DZldkV8ENxflxCxEZAtPfwVARCZczB4Vt4cp1Q2HhyMGFfvmhWQLswJXv53XhD1mtdSPCl~zBBSt1Ml4jMoMAZIKb9r~1wMlKh1rg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "8d1017f6-b52f-44de-b35f-19cc86b6b248",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Quedamos a las siete en la plaza?</strong></p><p>Fecha o horário e o lugar do encontro.</p><p>Esse trio funciona em mensagens ou conversas rápidas depois da aula, do trabalho ou antes de sair no fim de semana.</p>",
